                                                "sense_id": "8bd2d4a1-6a00-3625-9c98-7d2bcf3b93b1",
                                                "text": "You can stuff your rules, your insane ravings, your shouting, and your stupid \"theory\" right up your Khyber Pass. See a psychiatrist."
                                            }
